## 💡 Pro Tips

- ✅ **Always review** the decompiled Bicep — it may not be perfectly clean
- ✅ **Use parameters** instead of hardcoded values for reusability
- ✅ **Add descriptions** with `@description()` decorators
- ✅ **Format your code** with `az bicep format --file template.bicep`
- ✅ **Lint your code** with `az bicep lint --file template.bicep`
- ✅ **Version control** your Bicep files in GitHub

---

## ⚠️ Common Issues

| Issue | Fix |
|---|---|
| `az bicep` not recognized | Run `az bicep install` |
| Decompile errors | Some ARM features aren't supported — manually fix them |
| Wrong resource names | Update parameters to use `uniqueString()` |
| Deployment fails | Check `az bicep build` output for errors |

